===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Phantump|93}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Hook''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|61}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
